<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>404 - Không tìm thấy trang | SHOPVN</title>

    <link rel="icon" href="assets/images/logo/favicon.ico">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/responsive.css">

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:wght@300;400;500;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        *{
            margin:0;
            padding:0;
            box-sizing:border-box;
            font-family:'Roboto',sans-serif;
        }

        body{
            min-height:100vh;
            display:flex;
            justify-content:center;
            align-items:center;
            background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ee4d2d,#ff7337,#ffb357);
            overflow:hidden;
            position:relative;
        }

        body::before{
            content:"";
            position:absolute;
            width:700px;
            height:700px;
            background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
            border-radius:50%;
            top:-200px;
            right:-180px;
        }

        body::after{
            content:"";
            position:absolute;
            width:600px;
            height:600px;
            background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);
            border-radius:50%;
            bottom:-220px;
            left:-180px;
        }

        .card{
            position:relative;
            z-index:2;
            width:90%;
            max-width:760px;
            background:#fff;
            border-radius:28px;
            padding:70px 50px;
            text-align:center;
            box-shadow:0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.25);
        }

        .logo{
            font-size:34px;
            font-weight:900;
            color:#ee4d2d;
            letter-spacing:2px;
            margin-bottom:30px;
        }

        h1{
            font-size:150px;
            color:#ee4d2d;
            line-height:1;
            font-weight:900;
        }

        h2{
            margin-top:15px;
            font-size:34px;
            color:#222;
        }

        p{
            margin-top:18px;
            color:#666;
            line-height:1.8;
            font-size:17px;
        }

        .btn-group{
            margin-top:45px;
            display:flex;
            justify-content:center;
            gap:18px;
            flex-wrap:wrap;
        }

        .btn{
            text-decoration:none;
            padding:15px 34px;
            border-radius:50px;
            font-size:16px;
            font-weight:700;
            transition:.3s;
        }

        .home{
            background:#ee4d2d;
            color:#fff;
        }

        .home:hover{
            background:#d93d1f;
            transform:translateY(-4px);
        }

        .shop{
            background:#fff3ef;
            color:#ee4d2d;
        }

        .shop:hover{
            background:#ffe4da;
            transform:translateY(-4px);
        }

        .icon{
            font-size:65px;
            margin-bottom:10px;
        }

        @media(max-width:768px){

            .card{
                padding:50px 25px;
            }

            h1{
                font-size:100px;
            }

            h2{
                font-size:26px;
            }

            p{
                font-size:15px;
            }

            .btn{
                width:100%;
            }

        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="card">

        <div class="logo">
            SHOPVN
        </div>

        <div class="icon">
            🛒
        </div>

        <h1>404</h1>

        <h2>Không tìm thấy trang</h2>

        <p>
            Trang bạn đang tìm kiếm không tồn tại hoặc đã bị di chuyển.
            Hãy quay về trang chủ để tiếp tục mua sắm hàng nghìn sản phẩm hấp dẫn.
        </p>

        <div class="btn-group">
            <a href="index.html" class="btn home">
                🏠 Trang chủ
            </a>

            <a href="category.html" class="btn shop">
                🛍 Tiếp tục mua sắm
            </a>
        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>